OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fdry evening and night with mostly
OL,7,Fclear skies. Frost will become
OL,8,Fwidespread on the mainland, while the
OL,9,FIsles will be milder through breezy.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FAnother dry day with some long
OL,12,Fsunny spells for most though the far
OL,13,Fwest will turn cloudier later. Cold
OL,14,Fwith some frost early and late inland.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRain
OL,17,Fspreading east on Tuesday with snow on
OL,18,Fhigher ground for a time. Rain dying
OL,19,Fout on Wednesday then mainly dry on
OL,20,FThursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
